# Enforce binary format for image assets and keystores to prevent UTF-8 text mangling
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.aar binary

# Text files
*.kt text
*.kts text
*.java text
*.xml text
*.json text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.properties text
*.gradle text
*.txt text
